[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20941.35, "timestamp": "05:49:01", "text": "我见过这种情况。实际上有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20944.15, "timestamp": "05:49:04", "text": "关于它的日本民间传说，以及"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20946.628, "timestamp": "05:49:06", "text": "音乐视频。我想我们谈过这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20949.03, "timestamp": "05:49:09", "text": "最近在播客节目中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20951.67, "timestamp": "05:49:11", "text": "嗯，就声音方面而言。我没有直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20954.868, "timestamp": "05:49:14", "text": "上周就是这周了。呃，但是是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20957.75, "timestamp": "05:49:17", "text": "那里。我们谈到了我，我甚至还发了邮件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20959.548, "timestamp": "05:49:19", "text": "她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20963.23, "timestamp": "05:49:23", "text": "视频。是的。我记得这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20968.628, "timestamp": "05:49:28", "text": "是的。这不是假的，这是真的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20971.91, "timestamp": "05:49:31", "text": "太酷了。现在你就知道狗狗有多忠诚了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20974.788, "timestamp": "05:49:34", "text": "与此同时，Neco Chans 们则表示：“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20977.35, "timestamp": "05:49:37", "text": "荣誉已逝。我这就继续。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20980.19, "timestamp": "05:49:40", "text": "那是一种不同的荣誉。我到处闲逛吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20983.75, "timestamp": "05:49:43", "text": "大约。我，我，我停不下来。我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20985.628, "timestamp": "05:49:45", "text": "过我自己的生活"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20988.31, "timestamp": "05:49:48", "text": "生活琐事。我的意思是，那是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20991.35, "timestamp": "05:49:51", "text": "好办法，我的意思是，呃，这真是个好办法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20993.628, "timestamp": "05:49:53", "text": "现实。”但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20996.948, "timestamp": "05:49:56", "text": "是啊，但是那些打手就像，你知道的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20998.868, "timestamp": "05:49:58", "text": "我会一直等下去，一直等下去，一直等下去。"}]